{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-winson-and-olive-dinosaur-discovery-teepee-tent-sold-via-amazon-2604-0036","content_id":"76cdffd7-f932-4773-9098-a50bb29ce062","description":"Product Safety Report for Winson & Olive Dinosaur Discovery Teepee Tent presenting a serious risk of strangulation and injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"1a5028bd-19c8-418f-8ead-776cc96f3f95","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-08-18T11:07:57+01:00","id":"1a5028bd-19c8-418f-8ead-776cc96f3f95","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-08-18T11:07:57+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a842efc8d785493a9c8972c/2604-0036-product-safety-report-dinosaur-tent.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product:  Winson &amp; Olive Dinosaur Discovery Teepee Tent sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of strangulation as it is supplied with a string of lights and rope exceedingthe maximum permitted length for children’s toys.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Toys - Outdoor Play Structures</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>A And J Castle Enterprise Pty Ltd / Winson &amp; Olive</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>UK04 01/2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon Barcode</td>\n      <td>X001QNLNPJ</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Green play tent with 3 AA batteries supplied in plastic case.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_1a5028bd-19c8-418f-8ead-776cc96f3f95\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a842efc8d785493a9c8972c/2604-0036-product-safety-report-dinosaur-tent.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of strangulation because it is supplied with a string of lights and a rope which both exceed the maximum permitted cord length for children’s toys. These cords may wrap around a child’s neck if left unattended, presenting a risk of strangulation. The product also includes batteries which can be easily accessed without the use of tools. If a child accesses and swallows a battery, they could receive serious internal injuries.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2604-0036</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-18T10:08:28Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"toys","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-18","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-18T11:08:28+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path"